2026-07-27T09:36:17.5958489Z i Run duckdb(shared_home = TRUE) (or create ~/.duckdb) to keep them (suitable for most users).
2026-07-27T09:36:17.5959205Z i Run duckdb(shared_home = FALSE) to accept the temporary directory (and silence this message).
2026-07-27T09:36:17.5959941Z i See ?duckdb_storage for details and alternatives.
